1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:05,000
Morelord Marketplace brings flexible, immersive shopping directly into your Foundry VTT world.

2
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:13,000
Game Masters choose how the global marketplace behaves: buying, selling, or catalog browsing.

3
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:21,200
Set the value players receive when selling gear, and choose which compendiums supply the catalog.

4
00:00:21,200 --> 00:00:31,500
Players shop as their active character and always see the currency available to them.

5
00:00:31,500 --> 00:00:43,500
Fast search and detailed tri-state filters make even large compendium libraries easy to explore.

6
00:00:43,500 --> 00:00:55,500
Filter by type, rarity, source, price, weapon details, attunement, or only what the character can afford.

7
00:00:56,000 --> 00:00:59,000
Premium Shop Manager tools turn that catalog into a living part of the world.

8
00:00:59,000 --> 00:01:10,500
Start with a ready-made vendor prefab or manage an existing store.

9
00:01:10,500 --> 00:01:29,000
Each shop has its own identity, access rules, buying and selling controls, and a recognizable scene token.

10
00:01:29,000 --> 00:01:42,500
Choose which products and rarities the shop can offer, then shape its economy with reputation-aware pricing.

11
00:01:42,500 --> 00:02:06,500
Use unlimited inventory, randomized limited stock, or a hybrid, with automatic restocking or direct GM control.

12
00:02:07,000 --> 00:02:10,000
Place the finished vendor on the scene and let the party shop in character.

13
00:02:10,000 --> 00:02:24,500
Players choose who receives the equipment and which character or shared group actor pays.

14
00:02:24,500 --> 00:02:47,500
The cart tracks stock, purchase totals, and remaining currency before anything is committed.

15
00:02:48,000 --> 00:03:02,500
Every item keeps its artwork, rarity, source, and original compendium link close at hand.

16
00:03:02,500 --> 00:03:16,500
Marketplace handles currency and inventory transfers, with optional GM approval for global transactions.

17
00:03:17,000 --> 00:03:22,000
Morelord Marketplace. Because every adventure has a price.
